-- AUTOBLACKFLASH / COMPLETE TEN-COMBO MAIN / VOICES 10 / CACHED AUDIO DUCKING
-- One complete script, not an extension. Replace previous script; do not append it.
-- ASCII-only. Not live-tested. Requires executor gethui() and permitted virtual input.
-- Macro, rear-gated four-round chain, UI/search/drag, 10 ordered popup stages,
-- five random default sounds, custom Jackpot/Obito/Plus Ultra/Goku sounds,
-- rolling 3.5s countdown, pooled sparkles, 16-frame/0.8s kill finisher, unload.
-- Popup voices volume 10. Active game audio .12 multiplier; original volumes restored.
-- Audio cache indexed gradually, no full-game scan triggered by a popup voice.
-- Chain activation remains 3. D+Q, flick camera at enemy during dash, hold D until behind.
-- 30% rear sampling, <=8 studs, grounded/height check and 200ms stable gate.
-- Actual Black Flash/hit attribution is not verified by client timing/health loss.
-- Confirmed-only kill FX requires the earlier package's server confirmation event.
-- Kill finisher art: optional 16-frame PNG sequence over 0.8 s (20 FPS). Full set impact_01..16.png, reduced-flash set
-- impact_soft_01..16.png (chosen by "Reduced flashes"). Put them in the executor workspace folder. If they are
-- missing, the built-in vector finisher plays instead. Triggers are unchanged: confirmed kill, or estimated lethal.
